$ graphify install --project --platform kiro
  references       ->  .kiro/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .kiro/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
  .kiro/steering/graphify.md  ->  always-on steering written

Kiro will now read the knowledge graph before every conversation.
Use /graphify to build or update the graph.

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .kiro/

$ graphify kiro install
  references       ->  .kiro/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .kiro/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
  .kiro/steering/graphify.md  ->  already configured (no change)

Kiro will now read the knowledge graph before every conversation.
Use /graphify to build or update the graph.
